            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "● We assume that monthly aggregation of daily order-flow estimates is adequate for capturing the economically relevant variation in price impact for the purposes of one-month-ahead return forecasting, while treating intra-month variation as the object of interest for the higher-frequency robustness checks.",
            "block_bbox": [
                212,
