            "block_content": "We estimate two types of regression (contemporaneous and one-month-ahead) for the CRSP equity universe. Let StockRet $ _{it} $ denote the monthly return of stock i in month t. We define three order-flow-based explanatory variables, constructed entirely from CRSP daily data:",
